---
description: Project governance and release safety for the mobile stand CAD repository
alwaysApply: true
---

- Read and obey `AGENTS.md`.
- Keep Python/config as the geometry source of truth.
- Maintain `state/PROJECT_STATE.md`, `state/DECISION_LOG.md`, `state/ASSUMPTIONS.md`, and requirements traceability.
- Proceed autonomously on reversible work; consolidate fit/safety blockers in `docs/10_USER_INPUT_REQUIRED.md`.
- Never invent critical equipment, load, heat, electrical, transport, or manufacturer bend data.
- Never mark an artifact for production before the applicable gate passes.
- Use one geometry-source writer and independent non-editing review/verification roles.

